{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423446001:1":{"text":"あなたが平民を助けている司祭さんですか？サリエさんに言われて、何か手伝えることがないか聞きに来ました！","source_cn":"你就是那位想要救助平民的祭司吗？沙利叶让我们来问问你有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1153723E1DC04801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423446002:1":{"text":"ああ、ちょうどいいところに！実は、巾着が見つからなくて……平民街の子どもたちに食べ物を買うためのお金が入ってるんです……","source_cn":"你们来得正好！我的钱袋不见了……那是我给平民区孩子们买...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4E25810227A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423446003:1":{"text":"一緒に探してくれませんか？カバンの中がぐちゃぐちゃで……","source_cn":"能帮我找找我的钱袋吗？包里有点乱，请不要介意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB948841748DC943F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"優しい司祭","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}